## A ColorSamples request with two samples, then a bare Color that reads two floats, then a
## Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "colorsamples_request.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
ColorSamples [ 0.125 0.25 0.375 0.5 0.625 0.75 ] [ 0.875 1 1.125 1.25 1.375 1.5 ]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 1.625 1.75
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
